tem\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":5,"newStart":12,"newLines":6,"lines":[" messages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs"," `COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`)."," Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system","-prompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up","-messages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.","+prompt is two blocks, each with a `cache_control` marker. The first holds the static","+instructions and the second holds the per-athlete tail (date, profile, facts). A","+`save_fact` only rewrites the tail, so the instructions stay cached."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YaDZbVEdCjw7qJthncCJgX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
